{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fzhxR2P4gM1793257562.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港仔石排灣發生工業意外，兩名工人在高台工作期間，因平台不穩而「半天吊」，並發生碰撞，兩人受傷送院。</p><p></p><p>現場是石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分處，一男一女工人早上十點許，在這輛吊臂車平台上，進行大廈外牆維修工作。兩人有扣緊安全繩，期間懷疑平台不穩，導致兩人於離地四米「半天吊」，懷疑因踫撞而受傷。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WORKER-1230_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264hN9Pr1MUt1793257573.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>62歲男工人頭部受傷，一度昏迷，57歲的女工人就清醒，擦傷頭部及手腳，兩人送往瑪麗醫院治理，警方正調查意外原因。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:34.525890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:12.035943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:18.997885+00:00","content_hash":"3673f625a7515707a1a893675f5421f3abe7ab7be229f6bafdeb85e21d1706fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:34.525890+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}